  "description": "From distant Hanyang, interpreter Byeon Seung-Jun came seeking instruction from Choi Na-Ri. Learning belatedly of Choi Na-Ri's passing, he instead took his disciple Yeo An as his teacher. As lessons began, Byeon Seung-Jun's gaze toward his teacher Yeo An gradually changed...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
